ource:lushi_yinlv"],"exceptions":[],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","evidence":{"sourceId":"music:source:lushi_yinlv","normalization":"HTMLParser data joined by spaces; consecutive whitespace collapsed","normalizedTextChars":[6579,6830],"quote":"黃鐘生林鐘，林鐘生太蔟，太蔟生南呂，南呂生姑洗，姑洗生應鐘，應鐘生蕤賓，蕤賓生大呂，大呂生夷則，夷則生夾鐘，夾鐘生無射，無射生仲呂。三分所生，益之一分以上生；三分所生，去其一分以下生。黃鐘、（太）〔大〕呂、太蔟、夾鐘、姑洗、仲呂、蕤賓為上，林鐘、夷則、南呂、無射、應鐘為下。 大聖至理之世，天地之氣，合而生風，日至則月鐘其風，以生十二律。仲冬日短至，則生黃鐘。季冬生大呂。孟春生太蔟。仲春生夾鐘。季春生姑洗。孟夏生仲呂。仲夏日長至，則生蕤賓。季夏生林鐘。孟秋生夷則。仲秋生南呂。季秋生無射。孟冬生應鐘。","quoteSha256":"0edd5d065666a9e83eacb0eb635f184aee3f7864022c7edd76006721f9e8fe80"}},{"id":"music:chinese:lushi:season:11","nativeName":"孟冬","aliases":[],"unit":"native-seasonal-period-position","tradition":"Chinese","witnessId":"LuShiChunqiu-YinLv","position":{"generation":null,"sequence":11,"cyclicCoordinate":null,"orientation":null},"sourceRefs":["music:source:lushi_yinlv"],"exceptions":[],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","evidence":{"sourceId":"music:source:lushi_yinlv","normalization":"HTMLParser data joined by spaces; consecutive whitespace collapsed","normalizedTextChars":[6579,6830],"quote":"黃鐘生林鐘，林鐘生太蔟，太蔟生南呂，南呂生姑洗，姑洗生應鐘，應鐘生蕤賓，蕤賓生大呂，大呂生夷則，夷則生夾鐘，夾鐘生無射，無射生仲呂。三分所生，益之一分以上生；三分所生，去其一分以下生。黃鐘、（太）〔大〕呂、太蔟、夾鐘、姑洗、仲呂、蕤賓為上，林鐘、夷則、南呂、無射、應鐘為下。 大聖至理之世，天地之氣，合而生風，日至則月鐘其風，以生十二律。仲冬日短至，則生黃鐘。季冬生大呂。孟春生太蔟。仲春生夾鐘。季春生姑洗。孟夏生仲呂。仲夏日長至，則生蕤賓。季夏生林鐘。孟秋生夷則。仲秋生南呂。季秋生無射。孟冬生應鐘。","quoteSha256":"0edd5d065666a9e83eacb0eb635f184aee3f7864022c7edd76006721f9e8fe80"}},{"id":"music:chinese:zhouli","nativeName":"周禮注疏 卷23 witness","aliases":[],"unit":"native-text-musical-system","tradition":"Chinese","witnessId":"ZhouLi-ZhuShu23","position":{"generation":null,"sequence":null,"cyclicCoordinate":null,"orientation":null},"sourceRefs":["music:source:zhouli_zhushu23"],"exceptions":[],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","evidence":{"sourceId":"music:source:zhouli_zhushu23","normalization":"HTMLParser data joined by spaces; consecutive whitespace collapsed","normalizedTextChars":[15088,15141],"quote":"陽聲黄鍾大蔟姑洗蕤賓夷則無射陰聲大呂應鍾南呂函鍾小呂夾鍾皆文之以五聲宮商角徴羽皆播之以八音金石土革絲木匏竹","quoteSha256":"01562942e2fccde3e80b106864e3230ef28765bdf043138e3fd2b7a9752bc00a"}},{"id":"music:chinese:zhouli:category:陽聲","nativeName":"陽聲","aliases":[],"unit":"source-yin-yang-lu-category","tradition":"Chinese","witnessId":"ZhouLi-ZhuShu23","position":{"generation":null,"sequence":null,"cyclicCoordinate":null,"orientation":null},"sourceRefs":["music:source:zhouli_zhushu23"],"exceptions":[],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","statedExtent":{"value":6,"unit":"witness-named-lu-category-member"},"evidence":{"sourceId":"music:source:zhouli_zhushu23","normalization":"HTMLParser data joined by spaces; consecutive whitespace collapsed","normalizedTextChars":[15088,15141],"quote":"陽聲黄鍾大蔟姑洗蕤賓夷則無射陰聲大呂應鍾南呂函鍾小呂夾鍾皆文之以五聲宮商角徴羽皆播之以八音金石土革絲木匏竹","quoteSha256":"01562942e2fccde3e80b106864e3230ef28765bdf043138e3fd2b7a9752bc00a"}},{"id":"music:chinese:zhouli:pitch:陽聲:0","nativeName":"黄鍾","aliases":[],"unit":"witness-named-lu-category-member","tradition":"Chinese","witnessId":"ZhouLi-ZhuShu23","position":{"generation":null,"sequence":0,"cyclicCoordinate":null,"orientation":null},"sourceRefs":["music:source:zhouli_zhushu23"],"exceptions":["Native witness spelling retained. Cross-witness alias/concordance is a separate relation, not inferred by count."],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","evidence":{"sourceId":"music:source:zhouli_zhushu23","normalization":"HTMLParser data joined by spaces; consecutive whitespace collapsed","normalizedTextChars":[15088,15141],"quote":"陽聲黄鍾大蔟姑洗蕤賓夷則無射陰聲大呂應鍾南呂函鍾小呂夾鍾皆文之以五聲宮商角徴羽皆播之以八音金石土革絲木匏竹","quoteSha256":"01562942e2fccde3e80b106864e3230ef28765bdf043138e3fd2b7a9752bc00a"}},{"id":"music:chinese:zhouli:pitch:陽聲:1","nativeName":"大蔟","aliases":[],"unit":"witness-named-lu-category-member","tradition":"Chinese","witnessId":"ZhouLi-ZhuShu23","position":{"generation":null,"sequence":1,"cyclicCoordinate":null,"orientation":null},"sourceRefs":["music:source:zhouli_zhushu23"],"exceptions":["Native witness spelling retained. Cross-wi