":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":8246,"endCodePointExclusive":8308,"text":"開時，十四萬五千四百七十。下生閉掩。開時為宮，南中商，閉掩徵。 八日律，七寸三分小分九微強。準，七尺三寸萬七千八百四十一。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:517","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:族嘉","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:鄰齊","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"2/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"-1/3","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":8308,"endCodePointExclusive":8371,"text":"族嘉，十四萬三千五百一十三。下生鄰齊。族嘉為宮，內負商，鄰齊徵。 八日律，七寸二分小分九微強。準，七尺二寸萬七千九百五十四。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:518","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:爭南","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:期保","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"2/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"0","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":8371,"endCodePointExclusive":8433,"text":"爭南，十四萬一千五百八十二。下生期保。爭南為宮，物應商，期保徵。 八日律，七寸一分小分九強。準，七尺一寸萬八千三百二十七。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:519","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:姑洗","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:應鐘","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"2/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"0","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":8433,"endCodePointExclusive":8495,"text":"姑洗，十三萬九千九百六十八。下生應鐘。姑洗為宮，蕤賓商，