chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":8847,"endCodePointExclusive":8908,"text":"南中，十二萬九千三百八。上生丙盛。南中為宮，安度商，丙盛徵。 七日律，六寸五分小分七微弱。準，六尺五寸萬三千六百八十五。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:527","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:內負","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:分動","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"-1/3","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":8908,"endCodePointExclusive":8970,"text":"內負，十二萬七千五百六十七。上生分動。內負為宮，歸嘉商，分動徵。 八日律，六寸四分小分八強。準，六尺四寸萬五千九百五十八。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:528","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:物應","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:質末","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"0","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":8970,"endCodePointExclusive":9031,"text":"物應，十二萬五千八百五十。上生質末。物應為宮，否與商，質末徵。 七日律，六寸三分小分九強。準，六尺三寸萬八千四百七十一。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:529","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:蕤賓","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:大呂","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"0","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":9031,"endCodePointExclusive":9093,"text":"蕤賓，十二萬四千四百一十六。上生大呂。蕤賓為宮，夷則商，大呂徵。 一