inese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10103,"endCodePointExclusive":10165,"text":"歸期，十萬二千一百六十九。上生路時。歸期為宮，未育商，路時徵。 六日律，五寸一分小分九微強。準，五尺一寸萬七千八百五十七。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:547","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:未卯","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:形始","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"0","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10165,"endCodePointExclusive":10222,"text":"未卯，十萬七百九十四。上生形始。未卯為宮，遲時商，形始徵。 六日律，五寸一分小分二微強。準，五尺一寸四千八十七。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:548","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:夷汗","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:依行","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"-2/3","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10222,"endCodePointExclusive":10277,"text":"夷汗，九萬九千四百三十七。上生依行。夷汗為宮，色育商，依行徵。. 七日律，五寸小分五強。準，五尺萬二百二十。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:549","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:無射","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:中呂","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"0","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10277,"endCodePointExclusive":10336,"text":"無射，九萬八千三百四。上生中呂。無射為宮，執始商，中呂徵。 八日律，四寸九分小分九強。準，四尺九寸萬八千五百七十三。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:550","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:閉掩","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:南中","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"4/3","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10336,"endCodePointExclusive":10395,"text":"閉掩，九萬六千九百八十。上生南中。閉掩為宮，丙盛商，南中徵。 八日律，四寸九分小分三弱。準，四尺九寸五千三百三十三。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:551","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:鄰齊","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:內負","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"1/3","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10395,"endCodePointExclusive":10457,"text":"鄰齊，九萬五千六百七十五。上生內負。鄰齊為宮，分動商，內負徵。 七日律，四寸八分小分六微強。準，四尺八寸萬一千九百六十六。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:552","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:期保","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:物應","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"-2/3","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10457,"endCodePointExclusive":10519,"text":"期保，九萬四千三百八十八。上生物應。期保為宮，質末商，物應徵。 八日律，四寸七分小分九微強。準，四尺七寸萬八千七百七十九。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:553","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:應鐘","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:蕤賓","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"0","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10519,"endCodePointExclusive":10577,"text":"應鐘，九萬三千三百一十二。上生蕤賓。應鐘為宮，大呂商，蕤賓徵。 一日律，四寸七分小分四微強。準，四尺七寸八千十九。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:554","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:分烏","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:南事","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"-2","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10577,"endCodePointExclusive":10635,"text":"分烏，九萬三千一百一十七。上生南事。分烏窮次，無徵，不為宮。 七日律，四寸七分小分三微強。準，四尺七寸六千五十九。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:555","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:遲內","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:盛變","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"-1/3","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10635,"endCodePointExclusive":10694,"text":"遲內，九萬二千五十六。上生盛變。遲內為宮，分否商，盛變徵。 八日律，四寸六分小分八弱。準，四尺六寸萬五千一百四十二。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:556","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:未育","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:離宮","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"2189/3","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10694,"endCodePointExclusive":10753,"text":"未育，九萬八百一十七。上生離宮。未育為宮，凌陰商，離宮徵。 八日律，四寸六分小分一少強。準，四尺六寸二千七百五十二。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:557","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:遲時","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:制時","type":"source-generates-next-lu","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"],"lengthMultiplierExact":"4/3","sourceIntegerResidual":"0","evidence":{"sourceId":"chinese-expanded:houhan91","normalizedTextPath":"state/research/chinese-expanded/houhan91.normalized.txt","startCodePoint":10753,"endCodePointExclusive":10812,"text":"遲時，八萬九千五百九十五。上生制時。遲時為宮，少出商，制時徵。 六日律，四寸五分小分五強。準，四尺五寸萬二百一十五。 "}},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:558","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:黃鐘","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:gong-context:黃鐘","type":"serves-as-gong-in-source-context","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"]},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:559","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:gong-context:黃鐘","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:role:黃鐘:宮","type":"has-source-role-member","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"]},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:560","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:role:黃鐘:宮","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:standard:黃鐘","type":"uses-witness-lu-standard","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"]},{"id":"chinese-expanded:relation:561","source":"chinese-expanded:houhan:gong-context:黃鐘","target":"chinese-expanded:houhan:role:黃鐘:商","type":"has-source-role-member","sourceRefs":["chinese-expanded:houhan91"],"assertionLayer":"source-assertion","viewIds":["chinese-expanded:jingfang60"]},{